      "heading": "The short version",
      "html": "<ul><li>A compliance inspection checks a real thing against a set standard. An audit checks a process.</li><li>Inspections happen because of the law, a contract, or good practice.</li><li>UK duties come from laws such as HSWA 1974, PUWER, LOLER, CDM 2015 and the gas and electrical rules.</li><li>The report is the proof. Make it on site, not from memory days later.</li><li>Quickler asks the questions in WhatsApp and writes the report.</li></ul>"
