      "heading": "Inspection, not audit",
      "html": "<p>A compliance inspection is a planned look at a real thing, such as an installation, a vehicle, a building or a machine. It decides whether it meets a set standard at one point in time.</p><p>An audit looks at a system or process.</p>"
